  "summary": "In C9, thresholds are built per buggy day-of-year (non-leap years shift days after Feb by -1, no \u00b15-day window) from a pool of all finite region-cell values on exactly matching baseline dates. The pool percentile is broadcast to every cell, then smoothed over 31 days. Target days 2012-06-01..08-31 (DOY 153-244) use raw DOYs 138-259, i.e. leap years May 17-Sep 15 and non-leap years May 19-Sep 17. The mask is simply SST >= threshold AND sea_cells for each target day, written to output/mhw_mask.nc."
